WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.480
So I have my Black Label. I
wasn't just messing around.

2
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:10.860
If anyone else would like to pour
a little something in his honor,

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.370
add a little water to it. Never Blue
Label, though, because that gets him

4
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.210
too drunk too fast. I got the arak.

5
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.120
He liked the arak, so
I got an arak for him.

6
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:27.360
No, not the arak. He was
always the Black Label guy.

7
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.210
The whiskey and the arak. There were
times he was by me and wanted arak when

8
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.280
I didn't have what he wanted as a whiskey.

9
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.900
I'm sure there were plenty
of nights where he had both.
